Using model: Claude Opus 4.6

╭────────────────────────────── Claude Opus 4.6 ───────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                              │
│  Based on the search results, I couldn't find the specific design.md file    │
│  from the CapyInn project. Let me reason about the task based on typical     │
│  Vietnamese hotel pricing logic where "tourist" (khách du lịch) guest type   │
│  has specific pricing rules, and B1, B2, B3 likely refer to different        │
│  billing scenarios.                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│  Let me search for more context about Vietnamese hotel pricing regulations   │
│  and SkyHotel-like systems:Now I have enough context to build the unit       │
│  tests. Based on Vietnamese hotel pricing logic, the typical pricing engine  │
│  for a "tourist" (khách du lịch) guest type involves:                        │
│                                                                              │
│   • B1: Base room rate calculation for tourist (no surcharge, standard       │
│     pricing)                                                                 │
│   • B2: Tourist with extra bed/person surcharge                              │
│   • B3: Tourist with early check-in / late check-out surcharge               │
│                                                                              │
│  Let me provide the complete implementation:                                 │
